  id: help_creatures
  displayName: Cave creatures
  order: 510
  category: Dangers
  icon: item_chitin
  body: 'From the stone layer down, creatures live in the caves. They wake when you break into their cave (a card says how many) and hunt ants that come near.


    Send soldiers first, wall off a cave you''re not ready for, or paint Avoid over it. Killed creatures drop chitin and other finds, and give a little knowledge.


    Mole crickets dig toward the nest through soft ground; their tunnel shows through the dark as they come.'
  reveal: 1
